---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
import { EDUCATION, EXPERIENCE } from '../data/resume';
---

<Base title="关于" description={`关于 ${SITE.author}：教育背景与实习经历。`}>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>关于</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      我是 {SITE.author}，在 GitHub 上叫
      <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{SITE.handle}</a>。本科读数学，现在在新加坡国立大学读人工智能硕士。
    </p>
    <p>
      最近的精力主要放在编程 Agent 的工程问题上：怎么让一次长任务可以中断后恢复、每一步都能被检查、花费不失控，以及怎么用离线评测判断一个改动到底有没有变好。
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">教育</h2>
  <ol class="timeline">
    {
      EDUCATION.map((edu) => (
        <li>
          <div class="row">
            <h3>
              {edu.school}
              <span class="sub">
                {edu.major} · {edu.degree}
              </span>
            </h3>
            <span class="mono muted period">{edu.period}</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="facts">
            {edu.details.map((d) => (
              <li>{d}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <h2 class="section-title">实习经历</h2>
  <ol class="timeline">
    {
      EXPERIENCE.map((job) => (
        <li>
          <div class="row">
            <h3>
              {job.company}
              <span class="sub">{job.role}</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="mono muted period">{job.period}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="summary">{job.summary}</p>
          <ul class="points">
            {job.highlights.map((h) => (
              <li>
                {h.title && <strong>{h.title}：</strong>}
                {h.text}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <ul class="chips stack" aria-label="技术栈">
            {job.stack.map((s) => (
              <li class="chip">{s}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>关于这个站点</h2>
    <p>这里整理我的工程项目和经历，也记录三个方向的技术与学习笔记。</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Agent 工程实践与评测复盘，记录设计取舍、实验结果和踩过的坑</li>
      <li>AI for Math 与形式化验证观察，包括 Lean 和自动证明</li>
      <li>从数学转向 AI 工程的学习与转码复盘</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>联系</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.email && <>求职邮箱 <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><br /></>}
      <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .timeline {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .timeline > li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 2rem 1.4rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .timeline > li:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline > li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.55rem;
    left: -0.3rem;
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .sub {
    margin-left: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .period {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .summary {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .facts,
  .points {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .facts li::marker,
  .points li::marker {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .points li + li {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .stack {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .prose:last-child {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
